      "name": "LawLink",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "MIT 许可、可自托管的法律案件/项目管理系统，以案件（Matter）为记录单位，串接收案、冲突检索、程序阶段、当事人、法院来件、期限、财务、审批和结案归档；本次只记录公开仓库核心，不把路线图写成已实现。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/lawflow-boop/LawLink",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/lawflow-boop/LawLink",
      "github_repository_id": 1261406772,
      "license": "MIT",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lawflow-boop/LawLink/main/LICENSE",
